<html lang='en'>

  <head>
    <meta http-equiv='Content-Type' content='text/html; charset=utf-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Your Local Address Base Has Been Published</title>
    <style>
      body { background-color: #F5F6F7; color: #234361; font-family: "SF UI
      Text", -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica,
      Arial, sans-serif, "Apple Color Emoji", "Segoe UI Emoji", "Segoe UI
      Symbol"; margin: auto; padding: 25px; } a { text-decoration: none; }
      button { background-color: #003b80; border: none; border-radius: 3px;
      padding: 10px; } img { max-height: 45px; background-color: #F5F6F7; } .bal
      { font-size: 25px; font-weight: bold; } .container { background-color:
      #ebeff3; padding: 25px; } .forceWhiteLink button a { color:#FFF!important;
      } .infos { margin-top: 35px; } .title { align-items: center;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #E4E7EB; justify-content: center; margin-top:
      35px; min-height: 10em; padding: 10px; text-align: center; }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div>
      <img
        src='{{apiUrl}}/public/images/logo-adresse.png'
        alt='National Address Platform Logo'
      />
    </div>
    <div class='title'>
      <h2 style='margin:0; mso-line-height-rule:exactly;'>Congratulations!</h2><br
      />
      <h3 style='margin:0; mso-line-height-rule:exactly;'>Your Local Address
        Base has been published!</h3>
    </div>

    <div class='container'>
      <section>
        <h4>A Real Benefit for Your Jurisdiction</h4>
        <p>The addresses in your jurisdiction are now up to date and feed
          into <b>the national address database</b>.</p>
        <p>It is now easier for your residents to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Register with utility providers (water, electric, gas)</li>
          <li>Qualify for broadband and fiber internet service</li>
          <li>Receive mail and package deliveries</li>
          <li>Be located by emergency services (911)</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h4>Where Can You View Your Addresses?</h4>
        <p>
          Your addresses will be integrated into the National Address Database and
          available within <b>a few hours</b>.<br />
          They will be viewable directly from our
          <b>interactive map</b> here:
        </p>
        <span class='forceWhiteLink'><button><a
              href='{{apiUrl}}/national-address-database/{{codeCommune}}'
              target='blank'
            >View the National Address Database</a></button></span>
        <p>
          You can track the status of your addresses on the jurisdiction
          information page and download the National Address Database for your
          jurisdiction here:
        </p>
        <span class='forceWhiteLink'><button><a
              href='{{apiUrl}}/jurisdiction/{{codeCommune}}'
              target='blank'
            >View my jurisdiction page</a></button></span>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h4>Continue Editing This Local Address Base</h4>
        <p>
          If you would like to <b>update</b> your addresses or make
          <b>corrections</b>, simply continue editing this Local Address
          Base.<br />
          Changes will be <b>saved automatically</b>
          and transmitted to the National Address Database.
        </p>

        <p>You can continue managing your
          <b><i>Local Address Base</i></b> here:
        </p>
        <span class='forceWhiteLink'><button><a
              href='{{editorUrl}}'
              target='blank'
            >Manage my addresses</a></button></span>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h4>You Are Not Alone</h4>
        <p>
          <b>Every day</b>, new Local Address Bases are contributing to the
          National Address Database, just as you have done.<br />
          See the <b>nationwide deployment of Local Address Bases</b> here:
        </p>
        <span class='forceWhiteLink'><button><a
              href='{{apiUrl}}/lab-deployment'
              target='blank'
            >LAB Coverage Map</a></button></span>
      </section>
    </div>
  </body>

  <footer>
    <p>If you encounter any issues, access to the
      <b><i>Local Address Base</i></b>
      can be reset upon request.</p>

    <span><i>The National Address Platform Team</i></span>
    <p class='infos'>
      <small>
        <i>Administration token (expert information):
          {{baseLocale.token}}</i>
      </small>
      <div>If the button above does not work, paste the following URL into
        your browser's address bar:
        <b>{{editorUrl}}</b></div>
    </p>
  </footer>
</html>
